  "id": "mbi",
  "term": "MBI",
  "definition": "MBI stands for mild behavioral impairment, a pre-dementia syndrome in which neuropsychiatric symptoms appear before clear cognitive decline can be detected. It is considered relevant to prevention efforts in neurodegenerative disorders because these behavioral changes may come early in the disease process.",
